Action: evaluate_strategy
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool3","trim_pct":0.1,"rationale":"lighter trim on stable pool"}

Thought: Reduce redundancy in the model pool and test a simple mean on the pruned set to see if fewer, more diverse models improve performance.  
