Action Input: {"pool":"pool5","metric":"rmse"}  

Thought: evaluate the inverse‑error weighted combination on pool5.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weights","weights":"w4","rationale":"inverse‑error weighting on top 3"}  

Thought: try forward‑selection weighting on the larger pool4 to capture complementary models.  
Action: weights_forward  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool4","max_steps":20,"metric":"rmse"}  

Thought: evaluate the forward‑selection weighted combination on pool4.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weights","weights":"w5","rationale":"forward selection weighting on pool4"}

