Action: weights_inverse_error  
Action Input: {"pool":"pool4","metric":"rmse","shrinkage":0.5}

Thought: Evaluate the inverse-error weights already computed (w5) to see if it improves over plain mean, then generate a Caruana forward-selection weight vector on the reduced pool and evaluate it.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
