Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weights","weights":"w5","rationale":"inverse-error weights with 0.5 shrinkage on reduced pool"}

Thought: The weighted inverse‑error strategy on the full pool (a15) gives the lowest validation score and matches the robust combination hint for a trend‑dominated, highly predictable series with unstable rankings and correlated errors.  
Action: accept  
